      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i keep seeing everyone on my feed using that \"mindful\" emoji or phrase like it's some kind of meme but it feels so forced and weirdly synchronized. like i'm seeing it way more than usual all at once. u think there's some kind of subtext to why these specific terms get pushed so hard by the algorithm? i feel like i'm being tested to see if i'll just adopt the new vocab without thinking.",
